 "notes": {
  "cpu_mock": "bench/scrub_sim.KinematicScrub: RustState abrasion + UR3 forward kinematics from the lift URDF, the env's DLS IK and virtual-spring contact, first-order joint lag tau=D/K=0.05 s instead of PhysX PD dynamics; builds the policy's exact 327-D observation. Every arm sees identical seeded scenarios (bench.stats.episode_seeds, make_scenario); every episode gets a new rust patch mid-run (3-10 s). Force setpoint clamped to <= 38 N for all arms.",
  "target_interface": "Gemini, greedy and random choose [d_theta, d_z, press]; the brush moves to that target at the same 0.01 m/step limit as the PPO action, force setpoint 5+40*press N.",
  "isaac_lab": "bench/isaac_scrub.py in Rig-Scrub-Go2UR3Lift-v2 on watson (PhysX), first episode of each of N envs with one env seed, so all arms get the same initial scenarios (scenario_hash)."
 },
